Draw debug tools (WIP, flashlight-cone investigation)

AURORA_DRAW_LOG: EFB copy / pass split events with the command position, at=pass:cmd per draw,
AURORA_DRAW_LOG_MTX (texture/position/projection matrices), AURORA_DRAW_LOG_VTX (eye-space vertices
and GX z24 per primitive), AURORA_DRAW_LOG_TEXDIR (I4/I8/IA8 texture dumps), AURORA_DRAW_STOP=<n>|copy
and AURORA_DRAW_STOP_MATCH (drop the rest of the frame, copies keep the EFB). Skipped draws no longer
let their later primitives merge into the previous draw. Experiments (env only): AURORA_Z24_EXP,
AURORA_EXP_SRTG_NOZ, AURORA_EXP_SRTG_NOWRITE, AURORA_EXP_ZFREEZE_LOG.

